NOTE ON ORIGINALITY AND COPYRIGHT
=================================
The MIT license above covers ONLY the original code, art, level data, and
documentation authored by this project's contributors.

This project is a clean-room re-imagining inspired by the gameplay of КЛАД
(Crocodile Software, 1991) for the Электроника МС-0511 (УКНЦ), which itself
descends from "Rise Out From Dungeons" (ASCII Corp., 1983). No code, graphics,
level layouts, or other assets from those works are copied or redistributed
here. The disassembly and notes under docs/reverse/ and disassembly/ describe
observed behaviour for interoperability/study purposes only; the original
binary itself is git-ignored and never committed.
